<urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:guard> a logic:Formula ; logic:and <urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:g0>, <urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:g1> .
<urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:consequent> a logic:Formula ; logic:and <urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:guard>, <urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:t0>, <urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:t1> .
<urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:g0> a logic:Formula ; logic:relation <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> ; logic:argument [ logic:termIndex 0 ; logic:termVariable "this" ], [ logic:termIndex 1 ; logic:termIri gmeow:FinancialPeriodRate ] .
<urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:FinancialPeriodRate-frame:g1> a logic:Formula ; logic:relation gmeow:hasReferenceFrame ; logic:argument [ logic:termIndex 0 ; logic:termVariable "this" ], [ logic:termIndex 1 ; logic:termVariable "frame" ] .
